      "statement": "celld-ltx captures committed SQLite WAL data as L0 LTX segments and reports the captured position, and it is an owned 2026-08-03 snapshot of rustyriver (a Rust port of Litestream v0.5.11 behavior with the LTX v0.5.2 block format) that celld evolves without tracking upstream.",
