      "statement": "Db keeps the capture API synchronous around the !Sync rusqlite Connection, holding the checkpoint-takeover read lock with raw BEGIN/ROLLBACK plus a flag (idempotent release), with callers driving sync() and checkpoint() from a blocking context.",
