      "statement": "The capture path diffs the real WAL against the last LTX position to write the next L0 file atomically (tmp to rename) with a verify branch lattice for continuity breaks, and checkpointing follows a three-tier policy with anti-feedback flags plus a writer-barrier fix that seals passive checkpoints.",
