      "statement": "Ordinary cells truncate the WAL file at the next checkpoint beyond CELLD_LTX_TRUNCATE_PAGES (default 128 pages) because passive checkpoints do not shrink the file and every capture re-reads the stale region, while Queue cells use passive checkpoints because a truncate boundary emits a full database image.",
